# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data: raw and processed neuroimaging data are never committed.
# Tracked exceptions: the public phenotypic tables of the three cohorts (age,
# sex, motion covariates) and the atlas mapping tables in data/atlases/.
# The three processed HDF5 files must be copied in by hand (REPRODUCE.md).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/*
!data/atlases/
!data/ABIDE-II/
data/ABIDE-II/*
!data/ABIDE-II/ABIDEII_Composite_Usable20_Phenotypic.csv
!data/raw/
data/raw/*
!data/raw/Phenotypic_V1_0b_preprocessed1.csv
!data/ADHD-200/
data/ADHD-200/*
!data/ADHD-200/*/
data/ADHD-200/*/*
!data/ADHD-200/*/*_phenotypic.csv
# REST-meta-MDD (DIRECT Consortium). The data-use agreement forbids sharing the
# scans and the phenotypic workbook. data/* already ignores this tree. Do not add
# a "!" exception for data/REST-meta-MDD/, the phenotype xlsx, the Yan 2019
# subject list, or data/processed/rest_meta_mdd_fc.h5.
# SRPBS (ATR): the Multidisorder Connectivity Dataset (data/SRPBS*, SRPBS_FC.tar.gz)
# and the DecNef Harmonization Dataset (data/SourceCodeAndDATA/) are covered by
# signed non-redistribution terms. Never add a "!" exception for them or for
# data/processed/srpbs*.h5.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Checkpoints: the three frozen FC-VAE checkpoints the paper reports are
# tracked (checkpoints/<cohort>/fcvae_d64.pt + history); anything else is not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
checkpoints/*
!checkpoints/abide1_full/
!checkpoints/adhd200/
!checkpoints/abide2_10site/
checkpoints/*/flow*.pt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Results: the JSON files the tables are generated from are tracked for the
# three public cohorts; arrays, logs, figures and scratch runs are not.
# REST-meta-MDD results stay local under the data-use agreement: never add a
# "!" exception for results/rest_meta_mdd*. The same holds for results/srpbs*.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
results/*
!results/abide1_full*/
!results/adhd200*/
!results/abide2_10site*/
!results/simulation/
!results/theorem/
results/**/*.npz
results/**/*.png
results/**/*.log
results/**/figures/
results/**/*.before_fix.json
results/*_covrepair/
results/_queue*.ps1
results/cpu_queue.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX build artefacts (paper/main.pdf is tracked on purpose)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
paper/main.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python / tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.env
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
wandb/
mlruns/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor / OS / assistant artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.claude/
.code-review-graph/
CLAUDE.md

hand-off.md
